<title>POLAND: PPABank to hold rights issue in January.</title>
<headline>PPABank to hold rights issue in January.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish bank Pierwszy Polsko- Amerykanski Bank SA (PPABank) will conduct its planned one-for-four rights issue of 800,000 to 1.25 million shares in January 1997, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The move received shareholder approval in May.</p>
<p>The bank said it had sent a prospectus to the Polish Securities Commission (KPW) and had applied for the shares to be approved for public trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
